      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kawono, E Israel, wuwinj cik man lembapoka, m’aponjo kowu, kara wutimgi; kara wubed kwo, man wumond wumwony ng’om ma Yehova, Mungu pa kwaruwu, umio iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 22:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud wumed kum lembe m’ang’olo iwu, kadok kume moko de kud wukabi, kara wuwor lembang’ola pa Yehova Mungu mu m’ang’olo iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 25:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weng’wu neno gin ma Yehova timo ni kum Bal-peor; kum dhanu ceke m’ulubo Bal-peor, Yehova Mungu peri nyothogi kud i kindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento wun ma wumoko kum Yehova Mungu mu wubedo kwo i ceng’ maeni kubeng’wu kubeng’wu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen aponjowu ku cik man lembapoka, cil calu Yehova Mungu para ng’olo ira, kara wutim kumeno i kind ng’om ka ma wumondo i ie kara wumwonye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno wuwor man wutimgi; kum maeni en e rieko mu man ng’eyothelembe mu i wang’ kodhidhanu, ma biwinjo cik maeni ceke, man gibiwacu kumae, Andha thek maeni ma dit en e dhanu ma riek man weg ng’eyothelembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum thek ma dit ma kani ma nuti m’ubedo ku mungu ma ceng’ni i bang’gi kumeni, calu Yehova Mungu mwa bedo kinde ma tek walwong’e? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man thek ma dit ma kani ma nuti, m’ubedo ku cik ku lembapoka ma pwe kumeni calu cik maeni ceke, m’aketho i weng’wu i ceng’ ma tini?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndhu ibed ku weng’i i kumi giri, man igwok ng’eyong’ec peri cu, kara wii kud uwil kum gin ma weng’i neno, man kara ku giai kud i adundeni i nindo mi kwo peri ceke; ento keth ging’eiri ni nyithindhoperi man ni nyithindho mi nyithindho peri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ceng’ m’icungo i Wang’ Yehova Mungu peri i Horeb, kinde ma Yehova wacu ira kumae, Cok ira dhanu, man abiketho giwinj lembe para, kara gimak ng’eyo lwora i nindo ma gibedo i ie kwo i ng’om, man kara giponj nyithindhgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.16+EXO.19.17+EXO.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 19:16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E wubino ceng’ni man wucungo the got; e gode Wang’ ku mac cil kum adunde mi polo, ku mudho, kud afuru man mudho ma bi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova-yero iwu kud i die mac: wuwinjo dwal mi lembe, ento wu neno ayi gin moko ngo; wuwinjo dwal kende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 31:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 9:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eyero iwu lembariba pare, m’eng’olo iwu ya wutim, en e lembang’ola apar; man ekiewogi wi bankidi ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 21:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova rig’blo ira i nindo maeca nia aponjwu ku cik man lembapoka, kara wutimgi i ng’om ma wukadhu lokaca nimwonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
